{"conclusion":"术语撞名（跨条一致性）：补查 mod-tome，固定 commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63。data/timed_effects/mental.lua:2637-2648 定义 EFF SPELL_FEEDBACK（desc \"Spell Feedback\"，type=mental/subtype nature，activate 设 spe","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"9d7783a443b34888b95d8cd586e8f273eadc97149285a2d33d1657e93c8b2339","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"术语撞名（跨条一致性）：补查 mod-tome，固定 commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63。data/timed_effects/mental.lua:2637-2648 定义 EFF SPELL_FEEDBACK（desc \"Spell Feedback\"，type=mental/subtype nature，activate 设 spell_failure=eff.power，long_desc 为 \"The target suffers %d%% spell failue.\"，本条即其 on_gain 浮动文字 _t\"+Spell Feedback\"，见 2643 行）；data/timed_effects/other.lua:2667-2685 另有独立效果 EFF ANTIMAGIC_DISRUPTION（desc \"Antimagic Disruption\"，type=other/subtype antimagic，decrease=0、no_remove，长描述为佩戴反魔装备导致奥术技能失败）。两者是互不相同的运行时效果，但 data/locales/zh_hans.lua:36221、36224、36226 把 Spell Feedback 及 +/- 浮动提示译作「反魔干扰」，同文件 36632 行又把 Antimagic Disruption 译作「反魔干扰」，同名冲突使玩家在状态栏与浮动提示中无法区分「敌方施加的法术失败减益」与「自身反魔装备造成的常驻压制」。对照 ja_JP.lua:37377 与 ko_KR.lua:36826，其他语言对 Antimagic Disruption 使用了与 Spell Feedback 不同的名称。","sha256":"170c46c4942534ca95d6c2fd8b20877a552cb6d9a8df58979ccf044f6ba0755a"},"observation_contract":"translation_contextual_v2","observation_identity":"238aa38292233da48f2e70bf2f5e15fd39b1910342e3c7b5d5543cb2bbc4c45a","observation_sha256":"170c46c4942534ca95d6c2fd8b20877a552cb6d9a8df58979ccf044f6ba0755a","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
{"conclusion":"语义指代错位：补查 mod-tome，固定 commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，init.lua:102 载入提示原文 \"Some Sher'Tul artifacts can still be found in hidden places, but it is said they are not to be trifled with.\"","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"9d778f8fe7b06180a2c2d9e4eaa2e714ead3d29960a2f447056c49a892dbda40","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"语义指代错位：补查 mod-tome，固定 commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，init.lua:102 载入提示原文 \"Some Sher'Tul artifacts can still be found in hidden places, but it is said they are not to be trifled with.\"；they 指代前句的 artifacts（神器本身不可轻慢），it is said 只修饰后半句。译文「虽然有人说还能在某些未知的地方找到夏·图尔的上古神器，不过普通人最好不要接近那种地方」把传闻语气移到前半句（变成「有人说还能找到」），又把后半句的告诫对象由神器改成「那种地方」，并新增原文没有的主语「普通人」，使原文的「神器危险」被改写为「地点危险」，指代与告诫对象均与固定版本源文本不符。","sha256":"47f418a7bb525e0cea5f1e5a5735cdd5e7f1411beeb9ca4632f26b85a71f2445"},"observation_contract":"translation_contextual_v2","observation_identity":"defdbca64f989efedf5d43e36906a9530c42b9c6f5127e14e4d17ae5fb706231","observation_sha256":"47f418a7bb525e0cea5f1e5a5735cdd5e7f1411beeb9ca4632f26b85a71f2445","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
